## Parallel Waves

```
Wave 1 (parallelizable immediately — 3 tasks):
  T1  parity.bth.toml schema + validator
  T2  X1 cap-lattice grader (src/bathos/parity.py)
  T3  Skill section + helper scripts subdir

Wave 2 (after Wave 1 T1+T2 merged — 2 tasks parallel):
  T4  parity_validate.py + companion sidecar
  T5  attest_parity() + parity_confound_check() in claim.py

Wave 3 (after T5 merged — 3 tasks parallel):
  T6  F2 conclude-gate (campaigns.py + validate_claim)
  T7  F3 submit-gate (cli.py)
  T8  F4 CLI + MCP surface (cli.py + mcp.py)

Wave 4 (after T5 + T6 merged):
  T9  Signal 13 + sprint-audit integration
```

Minimum critical path: **T2 → T5 → T6 → T9** (4 sequential steps). T3 has zero code dependencies and can proceed at any time in parallel with any wave.

